* TR10 RX_SSB_DEMOD -- RC polyphase network + transistor-level summing amp.
*
* A direct-conversion SSB receiver already has the audio in I/Q form:
*   USB: I = A cos(wt), Q = +A sin(wt)
*   LSB: I = A cos(wt), Q = -A sin(wt)
* The polyphase network gives I a -45 deg low-pass shift and Q a +45 deg
* high-pass shift, so at the design frequency fc
*   I' - Q' = 0            (USB, nulled)
*   I' - Q' = 1.41 A cos   (LSB, passed)
* and the two swap when Q is inverted.  The differential pair below computes
* I' - Q' at its output, so it selects one sideband; the receiver's mode
* control inverts the Q channel (swap the Q TIA output polarity or the
* mixer's Q LO phase) to select the other one.
*
* Ports: i_in q_in out_p out_n vdd vss
*   i_in/q_in  TIA outputs, DC ~1.55 V, audio on top
*   out_p/out_n differential audio, DC ~2.5 V, AC couple to the next stage
*
* Default fc = 3 kHz (R=10k, C=5.3n), audio band ~300 Hz..3 kHz.
* The 1 uF / 100 kohm input coupling is a 1.6 Hz high-pass; it is common to
* both channels, so its phase shift cancels in the difference.
* Signal path is PDK MOS; the tail current is an ideal source for clarity.
* rgval=1 on every analog MOS (rgval=0 gives a singular OP).
.subckt RX_SSB_DEMOD i_in q_in out_p out_n vdd vss
.param fc=3k r=10k c=5.3n rbias=100k cc=1u itail=500u rload=10k

* ---- 1.55 V reference, matches the TIA output DC ------------------------
Rref1 vdd vref 6.9k
Rref2 vref vss 3.1k
* Bypass so vref is an AC ground; otherwise the 2.1 kohm divider
* impedance adds to Rhp and pulls the high-pass corner down.
Cref vref vss 1u

* ---- input AC coupling, 16 Hz -----------------------------------------
Cin_i i_in i_ac {cc}
Rb_i i_ac vref {rbias}
Cin_q q_in q_ac {cc}
Rb_q q_ac vref {rbias}

* ---- polyphase: I low-pass, Q high-pass, both at fc -------------------
* Both outputs sit at vref in DC so they can drive the pair directly.
Rlp i_ac i_lp {r}
Clp i_lp vss {c}
Chp q_ac q_hp {c}
Rhp q_hp vref {r}

* ---- differential summing pair: out_p - out_n ~ I' - Q' ---------------
X1 out_p i_lp tail vss NMOS_nf w=100u l=1u nf=4 rgval=1
X2 out_n q_hp tail vss NMOS_nf w=100u l=1u nf=4 rgval=1
Itail tail vss dc {itail}
R1 out_p vdd {rload}
R2 out_n vdd {rload}
.ends RX_SSB_DEMOD
